    <h3>Comments</h3>
    <div id="fiche_comments" class="ck-content collapsed" style="height: 30em;"><p>Reflective security feature on front:<br><a href="https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/60d68084e3c34.jpg" data-zoompic="" data-zoompicgroup="forum1685674916"><img src="https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/60d68084e3c34.jpg" alt=""></a><br>Â©gyoschak<br>&nbsp;</p><p>The note has a solid security strip that can be read under backlight. It has â€œBCM 2000â€ repeated on it:</p><p><a href="https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6817c8f146d70.jpg" data-zoompic="" data-zoompicgroup="forum1685674916"><img src="https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6817c8f146d70.jpg"></a></p><p><br>UV activity at 365nm:<br><a href="https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6817c851b8f7e.jpg" data-zoompic="" data-zoompicgroup="forum1685674916"><img src="https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6817c851b8f7e.jpg"></a> &nbsp;<a href="https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6817c85f88628.jpg" data-zoompic="" data-zoompicgroup="forum1685674916"><img src="https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6817c85f88628.jpg"></a><br>Â© Brandon Bertolli</p></div><button id="fiche_comments_toggle" class="secondary">Read more</button>
    


